    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... the more i think about it, the more it feels like the only way to actually stop the feeling is to just stop being here. the walls are so thick. i can't see a way to exist in this version of myself anymore. do you think there is even a way to break out of this without just destroying the whole thing?",
